    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >July Update</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udd95 Added new <strong>Blue Team</strong> \u2014 join the battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc1e Fixed various known bugs and improved overall gameplay experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udded Added item pickup hints for clearer feedback</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Added several new levels and items \u2014 more variety, more fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>June 3rd Major Update Details</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Visual Enhancements</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added all-new game asset library</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete visual overhaul for stunning effects</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Gameplay Expansion</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 new tactical items &amp; 4 unique terrains added</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Royale poison zone optimized:<br>\u2713 Smarter shrinking rhythm<br>\u2713 More intense final circle showdowns!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Control Improvements</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New minimap feature (better battlefield awareness)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revamped dash energy bar visuals (timing decisions clearer)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added mouse control support (precise inputs made easy)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Other Improvements</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various bug fixes and performance optimizations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Update now to experience the enhanced gameplay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Update 5.22 Patch Notes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This update delivers major combat experience upgrades! Key changes include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>New VFX System</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added dynamic particle effects for kills/deaths - combat feedback just got juicier!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf3 <strong>Immersive Screen Shake</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New camera vibration on character impacts for enhanced hit satisfaction</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1 <strong>Improved Role-Switch Clarity</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added prominent countdown timer: Final 3 seconds now display directly on pieces for better immersion</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc1e <strong>Miscellaneous Fixes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squashed several bugs for smoother gameplay</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Update Log (5.15)</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Battle Mode</strong> \u2013 Team up with friends for intense matches and start a battle anytime, anywhere!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Added Dash Indicator</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discord invite link:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(Pro Tip: Top contributors will be immortalized in future patch notes!)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle Royale + Action Roguelike</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the bell tolls\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt Mode:</strong> Become the <strong>Ebony Hunter</strong> and revel in the thrill of the chase.<br><strong>Escape Countdown:</strong> Descend into the <strong>Pale Prey</strong> and endure the suffocating struggle to survive.<br><strong>Cycle Unbroken:</strong> Each identity shift ignites a fresh battle for dominance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember\u2014your prey today may become your hunter tomorrow...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
